        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Kendrick Lamar, DJ Dahi, Drake, Jay Rock\n- Products: “Money Trees,” Good Kid, M.A.A.D City, Section.80, “Worst Behavior,” “Untitled 08 – 09.06.2014.”, untitled unmastered.\n- Roles: American hip hop recording artist, American rapper, Canadian rapper, producer\n- Topics: album releases, song credits\n\nFacts:\n- In 2011, Kendrick Lamar released his debut studio album Section.80 independently through the iTunes Store.\n- In 2012, Kendrick Lamar released Good Kid, M.A.A.D City as his second studio album.\n- “Money Trees” is a song by American hip hop recording artist Kendrick Lamar from his major-label debut studio album Good Kid, M.A.A.D City.\n- DJ Dahi is known for producing Drake’s “Worst Behavior” and Kendrick Lamar’s “Money Trees.”\n- “Money Trees” features Kendrick Lamar’s label-mate Jay Rock.\n- “Untitled 08 – 09.06.2014.”, previously titled “Untitled 2,” is a jazz rap song by Kendrick Lamar on the compilation album untitled unmastered.",
